  "date": "2026-08-22 05:00:00",
  "author": "Susan Aziz, Kevin Sundstrom",
  "siteName": "Vercel News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [--cs-video-width:min(1024px,calc(100vw_-_2_*_var(--geist-page-margin)))]\" data-customer-story=\"true\">\n   <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n    <h3 class=\"pt-10 text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#ora-on-vercel\" id=\"ora-on-vercel\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Ora on Vercel</h3>\n    <ul class=\"m-0 flex w-full list-disc flex-col gap-2 p-0 pl-5 [&amp;_li]:pl-2 [&amp;_li]:marker:text-gray-600\">\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Front end, back end, and agent runtime on one platform</p>\n     </li>\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Every major agent tested side by side on live sites</p>\n     </li>\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Hundreds of commits a day from a 16-person engineering team</p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Ora sends agents onto live websites with instructions to sign up for a product, integrate with it, and pay for it. Agents often fail, and by Ora's estimate, 99% of the web isn't agent-ready. The platform shows customers where and why agents fail, and what to change.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Assaf Elovic, co-founder of Ora, spent years helping agents discover the web. His previous company, <a href=\"https://www.tavily.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://www.tavily.com/\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">Tavily</a>, built a web search engine for AI agents and was acquired by <a href=\"https://nebius.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://nebius.com/\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">Nebius</a> earlier this year. Search solved half the problem, but an agent that finds a product still has to actually use it. He and co-founder Liad Yosef started Ora to measure how ready the web is for agents, and to fix the parts that aren't.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Today that means spawning agents against live customer sites from <a href=\"https://journey.ora.ai/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://journey.ora.ai/\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">journey.ora.ai</a>, where Ora runs a journey and records the cost, latency, and steps an agent needs to finish a task. The platform runs on Vercel, including the agent runtime.</p>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#benchmarking-every-major-agent-side-by-side\" id=\"benchmarking-every-major-agent-side-by-side\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Benchmarking every major agent side by side</h2>\n    <h3 class=\"pt-10 text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#every-harness-expects-its-own-infrastructure\" id=\"every-harness-expects-its-own-infrastructure\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Every harness expects its own infrastructure</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Agents decompose into two parts: a model, which does the reasoning, and a harness, the software that gives the model its tools and drives it from step to step. Ora's lineup covers the agents customers use most: Claude Code, ChatGPT, Gemini, Hermes, OpenClaw, and <a href=\"https://vercel.com/eve\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/eve\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">eve</a>, Vercel's agent framework. Ora runs each agent on a customer's website and watches how it handles common workflows.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">No two harnesses want the same infrastructure. Each expects its own environment and exposes its steps differently, so Ora runs a separate runtime for every harness and traces every step. Ido Finder, who leads engineering at Ora, calls that side-by-side coverage one of the most valuable things ora brings to its customers.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">When an agent stalls in a signup flow, the customer sees which step and what it tried. Without the trace, the result is a score with nothing behind it.</p>\n    <h3 class=\"pt-10 text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#one-platform-under-every-harness\" id=\"one-platform-under-every-harness\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>One platform under every harness</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Ora built this testing system entirely on Vercel. Front end, back end, and the agent runtime share the same deployment path, logs, and authentication. The agent runtime isn't separate infrastructure to operate; it lives where the rest of the product lives.</p>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#ora-benchmarked-eve,-then-built-on-it\" id=\"ora-benchmarked-eve,-then-built-on-it\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Ora benchmarked eve, then built on it</h2>\n    <h3 class=\"pt-10 text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#testing-eve-like-any-other-harness\" id=\"testing-eve-like-any-other-harness\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Testing eve like any other harness</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">When Vercel launched <a href=\"https://vercel.com/eve\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/eve\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">eve</a>, Ora gave it no special treatment. eve went through the same benchmark, under the same conditions, as every other harness in the lineup. Ora works with Vercel Engineering as a design partner, and Finder gave the eve team direct access to the platform to dig into the results.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">The initial test put eve against Claude Code across hundreds of real journeys on multiple domains. Both harnesses ran the same models, Claude Fable 5 and Haiku 4.5, and every run gave the agent the same job: integrate with a product.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Ora published three numbers from the comparison:</p>\n    <ul class=\"m-0 flex w-full list-disc flex-col gap-2 p-0 pl-5 [&amp;_li]:pl-2 [&amp;_li]:marker:text-gray-600\">\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">7% fewer steps to reach the goal</p>\n     </li>\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">2x native success: twice as many tasks finished on the customer's own site instead of falling back to web search</p>\n     </li>\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">9% more valid endpoints: more of the endpoints the agent found were ones it could actually call<!-- --></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">The benchmark fed back into eve, too. One run surfaced a prompt-caching issue, the eve team shipped a fix, and Ora's next round of results measured roughly 15% lower total cost.</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"gap-4 w-full h-full my-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/2)]\">\n     <div class=\"relative text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.2]! tracking-[-0.03em] w-full [&amp;_*]:inline\">\n      <span>You don't need to configure much on eve, it works out of the box, and parity with other harnesses is amazing to see.</span>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span aria-label=\"\" class=\"w-[var(--size)] h-[var(--size)] shrink-0 rounded-full inline-block overflow-hidden leading-0 align-top relative transition-[background] duration-200 ease-in-out after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:w-full after:h-full after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-[var(--ds-gray-alpha-400)] data-[mask=false]:rounded-md data-[mask=false]:after:hidden data-[mask=false]:before:hidden data-[resolved=false]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] data-[resolved=false]:before:w-full data-[resolved=false]:before:h-full data-[resolved=false]:before:absolute data-[resolved=false]:before:inset-0 data-[resolved=false]:before:rounded-full data-[resolved=false]:before:bg-gradient-to-r data-[resolved=false]:before:from-[var(--accents-1)] data-[resolved=false]:before:via-[var(--accents-2)] data-[resolved=false]:before:to-[var(--accents-1)] data-[resolved=false]:before:bg-[length:400%_100%] data-[resolved=false]:before:animate-loading [mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,white,black)] [-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,white,black)]\" data-geist-avatar=\"\" data-mask=\"true\" data-resolved=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" role=\"img\" style=\"--size:16px\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto max-w-full w-full h-full relative h-full! object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/f_auto,c_fill,w_32,h_32,q_75/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/7Kk94vZZWQTvprzpnmu78c/cc388baa35782d5ea6ed1fe0d6d800d3/ido_photo.png\"></span>\n      <div>\n       <span class=\"text-copy-14 text-gray-900 flex flex-wrap gap-x-2\"><span class=\"text-gray-1000\">Ido Finder</span> AI Lead @ Ora</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </blockquote>\n    <h3 class=\"pt-10 text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#the-framework-behind-ora's-own-agents\" id=\"the-framework-behind-ora's-own-agents\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>The framework behind Ora's own agents</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">For a company that benchmarks every major harness for a living, this is not a casual choice. After those results, Ora builds on eve.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Because eve follows the Next.js paradigm, there was little to configure, and tools, skills, and connectors take little code. The feature that sealed it was the sandbox override. An agent framework like eve ships with its own sandbox, the isolated environment where the agent executes, runs tools, and touches files. That's a good default for most teams, because you get safe execution for free. But an agent in the framework's own sandbox runs outside the instrumented environment where Ora traces every step. The override lets the team swap that environment in, so eve agents get recorded like every other harness, with nothing new built.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\"><a href=\"https://journey.ora.ai/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://journey.ora.ai/\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">Journey.ora.ai </a>now has eve on both sides, eve is one of the harnesses it tests, and eve is what it runs on.</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"gap-4 w-full h-full my-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/2)]\">\n     <div class=\"relative text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.2]! tracking-[-0.03em] w-full [&amp;_*]:inline\">\n      <span>I've been building agents since the technology first became available, and eve was the easiest setup I've experienced.</span>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span aria-label=\"\" class=\"w-[var(--size)] h-[var(--size)] shrink-0 rounded-full inline-block overflow-hidden leading-0 align-top relative transition-[background] duration-200 ease-in-out after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:w-full after:h-full after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-[var(--ds-gray-alpha-400)] data-[mask=false]:rounded-md data-[mask=false]:after:hidden data-[mask=false]:before:hidden data-[resolved=false]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] data-[resolved=false]:before:w-full data-[resolved=false]:before:h-full data-[resolved=false]:before:absolute data-[resolved=false]:before:inset-0 data-[resolved=false]:before:rounded-full data-[resolved=false]:before:bg-gradient-to-r data-[resolved=false]:before:from-[var(--accents-1)] data-[resolved=false]:before:via-[var(--accents-2)] data-[resolved=false]:before:to-[var(--accents-1)] data-[resolved=false]:before:bg-[length:400%_100%] data-[resolved=false]:before:animate-loading [mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,white,black)] [-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,white,black)]\" data-geist-avatar=\"\" data-mask=\"true\" data-resolved=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" role=\"img\" style=\"--size:16px\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto max-w-full w-full h-full relative h-full! object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/f_auto,c_fill,w_32,h_32,q_75/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/7Kk94vZZWQTvprzpnmu78c/cc388baa35782d5ea6ed1fe0d6d800d3/ido_photo.png\"></span>\n      <div>\n       <span class=\"text-copy-14 text-gray-900 flex flex-wrap gap-x-2\"><span class=\"text-gray-1000\">Ido Finder</span> AI Lead @ Ora</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </blockquote>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#how-16-engineers-ship-hundreds-of-commits-a-day\" id=\"how-16-engineers-ship-hundreds-of-commits-a-day\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>How 16 engineers ship hundreds of commits a day</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">The engineering team is 16 people shipping hundreds of commits a day, and day-to-day infrastructure work belongs to their coding agents. A stack that sits in one place lets those agents run it end to end.</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"gap-4 w-full h-full my-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/2)]\">\n     <div class=\"relative text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.2]! tracking-[-0.03em] w-full [&amp;_*]:inline\">\n      <span>Everything is consolidated into the same infrastructure, which makes our coding agents much more efficient. I don't even log into the Vercel UI. I ask my coding agents to run on the logs, debug everything, deploy, change environment variables.\" </span>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span aria-label=\"\" class=\"w-[var(--size)] h-[var(--size)] shrink-0 rounded-full inline-block overflow-hidden leading-0 align-top relative transition-[background] duration-200 ease-in-out after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:w-full after:h-full after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-[var(--ds-gray-alpha-400)] data-[mask=false]:rounded-md data-[mask=false]:after:hidden data-[mask=false]:before:hidden data-[resolved=false]:before:content-[&quot;&quot;] data-[resolved=false]:before:w-full data-[resolved=false]:before:h-full data-[resolved=false]:before:absolute data-[resolved=false]:before:inset-0 data-[resolved=false]:before:rounded-full data-[resolved=false]:before:bg-gradient-to-r data-[resolved=false]:before:from-[var(--accents-1)] data-[resolved=false]:before:via-[var(--accents-2)] data-[resolved=false]:before:to-[var(--accents-1)] data-[resolved=false]:before:bg-[length:400%_100%] data-[resolved=false]:before:animate-loading [mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,white,black)] [-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,white,black)]\" data-geist-avatar=\"\" data-mask=\"true\" data-resolved=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" role=\"img\" style=\"--size:16px\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto max-w-full w-full h-full relative h-full! object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/f_auto,c_fill,w_32,h_32,q_75/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/7Kk94vZZWQTvprzpnmu78c/cc388baa35782d5ea6ed1fe0d6d800d3/ido_photo.png\"></span>\n      <div>\n       <span class=\"text-copy-14 text-gray-900 flex flex-wrap gap-x-2\"><span class=\"text-gray-1000\">Ido Finder</span> AI Lead @ Ora</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </blockquote>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Finder puts the time saved at a few hours a week at least. Elovic credits a similar amount to how well coding agents build with Vercel's libraries.</p>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mt-auto mb-auto flex h-[1lh] max-h-8 w-8 -translate-x-full flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-900 opacity-0 transition-all duration-100 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100 scroll-mt-[90px]\" href=\"#what's-next\" id=\"what's-next\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>What's next</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Ora is adding more products, and the architecture is growing with them. The team is splitting its platform into microservices, all of them on Vercel. New services deploy to the same infrastructure and talk to each other with no extra configuration, and the internal agents built on eve will run as one more service.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">By Ora's own measure, 99% of the web still can't handle an agent that shows up to sign up, integrate, and pay.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\"><a href=\"https://ora.ai/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://ora.ai/\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">About Ora: </a>Ora makes the web agent-ready. Companies use ora to benchmark how AI agents discover, navigate, and interact with their websites, and to build the infrastructure agents need to find, use, and transact with them.</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Ora 借助 Vercel 在真实网站上测试主流 AI 智能体，揭示就绪度差距并优化自身框架。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Ora 借助 Vercel 在真实网站上测试主流 AI 智能体，揭示就绪度差距并优化自身框架。",
  "summary": "Ora 在 Vercel 上运行一个基准测试平台，让主流 AI 智能体——Claude Code、ChatGPT、Gemini、Hermes、OpenClaw 以及 Vercel 自家的 eve——在实际客户站点上同台竞技。通过追踪每个测试框架的步骤数、成本、延迟和成功率，Ora 揭示了智能体的失败之处，并表明 99% 的网站尚未为智能体做好准备。该基准测试也反馈给了 eve，发现了一个提示词缓存问题，修复后成本下降了约 15%。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Ora 提供了一个统一的 Vercel 平台，用于端到端的智能体测试。",
      "explanation": "Ora 将前端、后端和智能体运行时都托管在 Vercel 上，从而消除了独立基础设施，并让智能体与产品其他部分使用相同的部署路径、日志和身份验证。"
    },
    {
      "point": "基准测试显示 eve 在关键指标上优于 Claude Code。",
      "explanation": "在数百次真实任务中，eve 所用的步骤数减少了 7%，原生成功率翻倍，并多发现 9% 的有效端点；修复提示词缓存问题后，这些洞见还使 eve 的总成本降低了 ~15%。"
    },
    {
      "point": "测试表明，99% 的网站尚未为 AI 智能体做好准备。",
      "explanation": "由于测试框架的预期与实际网站不匹配，智能体在真实站点上经常失败，这表明大多数网站缺乏可靠的智能体驱动注册、集成和支付所需的基础设施。"
    },
    {
      "point": "Ora 的工程团队利用与 Vercel 集成的编码智能体，每天进行数百次提交。",
      "explanation": "借助整合的技术栈，编码智能体可以处理日志、调试、部署和环境变量变更，每周为工程师节省数小时，并提高生产力。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "你在 eve 上无需过多配置，它开箱即用，与其他测试框架的一致性令人惊叹。",
    "按照 Ora 自己的衡量标准，99% 的网站仍然无法应对一个要注册、集成并支付的智能体。",
    "所有内容都整合到同一套基础设施中，这让我们的编码智能体效率大大提高。我甚至不需要登录 Vercel 的界面。我让编码智能体去查看日志、调试一切、部署代码、修改环境变量。",
    "我从这项技术刚出现时就开始构建智能体，eve 是我经历过的最简单的上手体验。"
